      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": {
        "NlmCategory": "BACKGROUND",
        "Label": "INTRODUCTION",
        "content": "Tubal sterilisation is practised all over the world. This safe, easy and highly effective, long-term method for birth control can be carried out during the hospital stay for either a normal delivery or caesarean section. In India, female sterilisation accounts for 37.3% of all methods of family planning."
